# Per-Dockerfile ignore for apps/web/Dockerfile (replaces the root .dockerignore,
# which excludes apps/web and all Markdown). Keep the context small and clean.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.tanstack
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
.swarmy-dev-token
**/.swarmy
plans
issues
docs
sdks
terraform-provider-swarmy
packages/db/src/generated
**/*.log
.DS_Store
